# Predator Ooze: the second trigger needs the damaged creature to die (CR 603.2). On turn 3 Bot1's Ooze (a 2/2 with its attack counter)
# attacks and Hill Giant (3/3, paid with Black Lotus and Mountain) blocks it: the Giant takes 2 damage and lives, the indestructible Ooze
# survives 3, and it has only the one counter from attacking.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Predator Ooze
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mountain
Hill Giant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Predator Ooze.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Hill Giant.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Predator Ooze > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Block(Hill Giant > Predator Ooze)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield.Hill Giant.Damage = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Predator Ooze.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Predator Ooze.Damage = 3
